WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.937
Unit seventeen. Ethical Consumerism!

2
00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:13.035
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.085 --> 00:00:17.160
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.542
Today we learn: Ethical Consumerism. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.896
Ethical consumerism. Say it with me. Ethical consumerism!

6
00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:36.439
Sustainable brand. Say it with me. Sustainable brand!

7
00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:44.567
Fair trade. Say it with me. Fair trade!

8
00:00:48.094 --> 00:00:52.061
Boycott. Say it with me. Boycott!

9
00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.197
Consumer choice. Say it with me. Consumer choice!

10
00:01:03.697 --> 00:01:08.497
Supply chain. Say it with me. Supply chain!

11
00:01:11.995 --> 00:01:15.911
Conscious. Say it with me. Conscious!

12
00:01:19.419 --> 00:01:23.369
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

13
00:01:26.924 --> 00:01:37.087
Grammar time! Relative clauses (which or that). Listen. I support brands that use fair trade practices.

14
00:01:37.137 --> 00:01:43.047
Your turn. Say it with me. I support brands that use fair trade practices.

15
00:01:48.014 --> 00:02:03.189
Ethical consumerism means making a conscious consumer choice, like supporting a fair trade or sustainable brand. Understanding a product's supply chain helps shoppers decide when to boycott and where to spend for real impact.

16
00:02:03.239 --> 00:02:04.769
I like this story!

17
00:02:05.806 --> 00:02:11.020
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:12.220
Fair trade!

19
00:02:13.305 --> 00:02:18.520
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.720
Conscious!

21
00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:30.327
Think and answer. Do you consider ethics when you shop? Give an example.

22
00:02:30.377 --> 00:02:31.568
Great answer!

23
00:02:32.671 --> 00:02:35.449
This unit's value is Conscious Choice.

24
00:02:35.499 --> 00:02:38.091
I can show conscious choice every day!

25
00:02:38.963 --> 00:02:43.701
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:43.751 --> 00:02:45.444
Goodbye, everyone!

